
#RNAScope-Ancestry_Study

Scripts for the RNAScope-Ancestry study in collaboration with Dr. Robert Meller.

This repository contains the main scripts used for genetic ancestry analysis and downstream expression analyses for the RNAScope-Ancestry paper.

The workflow starts with RNA-seq-derived variants generated from the upstream GATK variant-calling pipeline. The scripts here cover variant filtering, common variant selection, LD pruning, PCA, ancestry inference, and comparison with 1000 Genomes reference populations. Additional scripts are used for sub-ancestry analysis and examining the relationship between ancestry and gene expression.

The ancestry estimates were also compared with ADMIXTURE and validated using the MAGE dataset.

Raw sequencing data will be available through dbGaP. Sample information is not included here because it contains sensitive participant information.

The initial RNA-seq processing and GATK variant-calling pipeline was developed in collaboration with Dr. Robert Meller and colleagues. The scripts in this repository cover the subsequent genetic ancestry analysis performed for the RNAScope-Ancestry study.
